WEBVTT

01:26.370 --> 01:29.720
[Glory]

01:30.670 --> 01:32.950
[Episode 31]

01:33.150 --> 01:35.200
Our forebears of every generation
hacked through thorns and brambles,

01:35.200 --> 01:36.789
building this family through hardship.

01:36.789 --> 01:37.560
They've painstakingly managed

01:37.560 --> 01:39.420
the tea plantation for 400 years.

01:39.789 --> 01:41.000
In the past, there were
cases like this as well—

01:41.000 --> 01:42.710
passing off inferior goods as genuine,

01:42.710 --> 01:44.440
disgracing our family's name.

01:44.950 --> 01:47.150
Father, you remember that, don't you?

01:50.000 --> 01:51.530
By the Rong family's rules,

01:52.710 --> 01:55.640
you should withdraw
from the clan of your own accord.

01:57.280 --> 01:58.810
How dare you be so insolent!

01:59.430 --> 02:00.230
Although you grew up

02:00.230 --> 02:01.280
with Grandmother

02:01.840 --> 02:02.350
and never received

02:02.350 --> 02:03.940
direct parenting from your parents,

02:03.940 --> 02:05.050
you must have studied the classics

02:05.050 --> 02:06.480
and learned proper etiquette

02:06.480 --> 02:07.150
to understand what is meant by

02:07.150 --> 02:08.960
the proper relationship between ruler
and subject, father and child.

02:08.960 --> 02:10.419
Parents to their children

02:10.470 --> 02:12.870
are like heaven and earth,
vast and mighty.

02:13.310 --> 02:14.910
How can you, a mere daughter,

02:15.240 --> 02:16.079
dare to speak such

02:16.079 --> 02:17.710
words that defy filial piety?

02:17.710 --> 02:19.590
Even if lightning doesn't strike you dead,

02:19.590 --> 02:20.850
the contempt of others

02:21.280 --> 02:22.610
would surely drown you.

02:24.150 --> 02:26.810
Lady Shanbao, filial piety
comes first in life.

02:27.520 --> 02:28.960
Since ancient times,
parents scolding their children has been

02:28.960 --> 02:29.960
perfectly natural.

02:29.960 --> 02:30.470
How could a daughter

02:30.470 --> 02:31.840
criticize her own father?

02:31.840 --> 02:33.300
This is greatly unfilial.

02:33.400 --> 02:35.150
Quickly apologize to your father.

02:35.150 --> 02:36.480
If this matter spreads,

02:36.560 --> 02:38.280
who would dare
take you as a daughter-in-law?

02:38.280 --> 02:39.610
How could you ever marry

02:39.630 --> 02:41.190
or establish yourself in society?

02:41.190 --> 02:42.000
How could this be

02:42.000 --> 02:43.810
the behavior of an obedient daughter?

02:43.810 --> 02:45.210
It's truly frightening!

02:46.400 --> 02:47.400
You all know about

02:47.940 --> 02:50.470
the proper relationship between ruler
and subject, father and child.

02:50.470 --> 02:51.870
The ancient saying goes:

02:52.000 --> 02:54.000
The people are most precious,
the state comes second,

02:54.000 --> 02:55.520
and the ruler is least important.

02:55.520 --> 02:56.750
A ruler who deceives his people

02:56.750 --> 02:57.960
cannot last long.

02:58.240 --> 03:00.900
If this applies to a country,
how about a family?

03:01.400 --> 03:02.910
You sell inferior tea.

03:03.360 --> 03:05.680
Damaging the Rong family's
century-old reputation is a small matter,

03:05.680 --> 03:08.280
but destroying the livelihood
of thousands of tea farmers is serious.

03:08.280 --> 03:09.610
If this matter spreads,

03:10.360 --> 03:11.120
those who covet

03:11.120 --> 03:12.750
the Rong family's business

03:13.030 --> 03:14.290
will show you no mercy.

03:15.000 --> 03:16.960
Tea farmers come
from deep in the mountains,

03:16.960 --> 03:19.190
with free spirits and fierce courage.

03:19.870 --> 03:21.560
Whoever dares to starve them

03:22.120 --> 03:24.030
will face machetes and hoes—

03:24.310 --> 03:26.970
they will cut off his head
and destroy his roots.

03:27.190 --> 03:28.120
Even I

03:28.400 --> 03:29.430
cannot stop them.

03:30.120 --> 03:31.560
You are my father,

03:32.150 --> 03:34.750
but not the father
of thousands of tea farmers.

03:34.750 --> 03:36.079
I can be forgiving,

03:36.470 --> 03:38.190
but they will show no mercy.

03:38.710 --> 03:40.190
Expelling you from the family

03:40.190 --> 03:42.390
is already the most lenient treatment.

03:42.710 --> 03:43.280
It's also for

03:43.280 --> 03:44.680
your own safety, Father.

03:45.079 --> 03:47.710
Before coming here,
I went to see Grandmother.

03:48.430 --> 03:49.560
Father, do you know

03:50.360 --> 03:51.690
what Grandmother said?

03:52.910 --> 03:53.560
What...

03:54.750 --> 03:56.280
What did Mother say?

03:59.630 --> 04:01.560
Disgrace! Fool!

04:02.430 --> 04:04.280
Go and bring him back.

04:04.280 --> 04:06.840
Hang him! I want him hanged!

04:13.400 --> 04:14.460
I don't believe it.

04:15.190 --> 04:15.800
How could Grandmother

04:15.800 --> 04:17.200
threaten to kill Father?

04:17.560 --> 04:19.019
He is her own son after all.

04:19.560 --> 04:22.000
Grandmother is the head
of the family first

04:22.660 --> 04:24.260
and our grandmother second.

04:26.070 --> 04:27.000
Steward Cheng.

04:40.390 --> 04:41.000
This...

04:42.360 --> 04:43.040
This is...

04:43.270 --> 04:45.270
Old Madam insisted on being carried

04:45.580 --> 04:47.120
and personally opened the ancestral hall

04:47.120 --> 04:48.630
to report to the ancestors.

04:48.630 --> 04:49.290
She said...

04:51.680 --> 04:53.310
Before you're expelled
from the family, Old Master,

04:53.310 --> 04:55.909
you must receive 100 lashes
with the iron whip.

05:01.240 --> 05:02.510
But thanks to Lady Shanbao

05:02.510 --> 05:04.240
who repeatedly begged for mercy
on your behalf,

05:04.240 --> 05:06.100
Old Madam finally granted mercy,

05:06.510 --> 05:08.160
allowing Madam and Master Shanhui

05:08.160 --> 05:10.160
to each take 20 lashes in your place.

05:12.350 --> 05:13.350
And Lady Yunzhen,

05:13.680 --> 05:14.740
being still young,

05:15.070 --> 05:16.870
will receive only 10 lashes.

05:17.240 --> 05:18.870
What... What did I do wrong?

05:19.800 --> 05:21.720
This was all Father and Mother's idea.

05:21.720 --> 05:23.580
What did my brother and I do wrong?

05:24.240 --> 05:26.100
Why is Grandmother punishing us?

05:26.240 --> 05:28.480
Grandmother can forgive
a thousand mistakes,

05:28.480 --> 05:29.920
but rats and worms within the family

05:29.920 --> 05:31.040
who ruin our tea business

05:31.040 --> 05:32.800
are what she hates most.

05:33.240 --> 05:34.700
Knowing your father was wrong

05:34.700 --> 05:35.780
yet not stopping him

05:35.780 --> 05:37.800
and failing to come to Linji
to inform Grandmother,

05:37.800 --> 05:39.000
you must be punished
for betraying the family

05:39.000 --> 05:40.040
along with him.

05:40.159 --> 05:42.800
How dare you!
Father is an imperial official.

05:43.240 --> 05:45.390
If he deserves punishment,
the court will decide.

05:45.390 --> 05:46.270
Who are you

05:46.270 --> 05:48.120
to inflict such punishment here?

05:48.120 --> 05:48.750
Just now you were

05:48.750 --> 05:50.280
talking about filial piety

05:50.560 --> 05:53.020
and now you dare to
talk back to Grandmother?

05:57.000 --> 05:58.000
Grandmother said

05:58.810 --> 06:01.490
Uncle Heting obtained his position
through family influence,

06:01.490 --> 06:03.450
and despite receiving 10,000 taels
of silver annually,

06:03.450 --> 06:04.720
he still wasn't satisfied

06:04.720 --> 06:07.450
and greedily opened tea shops
to make more money,

06:07.680 --> 06:09.750
proving his corruption as an official

06:09.750 --> 06:11.070
and disgracing our family name.

06:11.070 --> 06:12.360
After all, families have their own rules

06:12.360 --> 06:14.070
and clans have their own regulations.

06:14.070 --> 06:15.070
Even the law of the land cannot interfere

06:15.070 --> 06:17.430
when a family disciplines
its unworthy descendants.

06:17.430 --> 06:19.880
If you don't want
to follow clan rules, that's fine.

06:19.880 --> 06:20.790
Just return all the money

06:20.790 --> 06:22.680
that has been spent over these years

06:22.680 --> 06:24.240
and we'll call it even.

06:25.070 --> 06:26.830
Father, if you refuse to accept this,

06:26.830 --> 06:28.920
Grandmother will go
to the capital to file a petition,

06:28.920 --> 06:30.510
accusing you of being ungrateful

06:30.510 --> 06:32.110
and committing the crime of disobedience.

06:32.110 --> 06:34.640
By then, you would not only
lose your position

06:34.830 --> 06:36.630
but could be sentenced to death.

06:39.680 --> 06:41.000
No! I don't want to!

06:41.240 --> 06:42.700
I don't want to be whipped!

06:45.120 --> 06:45.680
Zhen!

06:46.120 --> 06:47.510
Someone come here!

06:47.680 --> 06:48.190
Zhen!

06:48.600 --> 06:49.120
Zhen!

06:49.310 --> 06:50.310
Let me go!

06:50.390 --> 06:52.310
What are you doing? Release me!

06:52.510 --> 06:52.950
Let go!

07:04.480 --> 07:06.800
Silence! No crying!

07:10.390 --> 07:12.040
It's just a few lashes.

07:13.000 --> 07:16.510
I can endure it.

07:21.850 --> 07:24.330
I cannot bear to watch
Father being punished,

07:24.330 --> 07:25.930
so I must take my leave first.

07:28.480 --> 07:29.080
Oh, right.

07:30.040 --> 07:31.300
Grandmother also said

07:31.600 --> 07:32.159
this house

07:32.159 --> 07:33.890
was purchased by her years ago.

07:34.390 --> 07:36.190
It was originally family property

07:36.190 --> 07:38.140
and shouldn't fall into outsiders' hands.

07:38.140 --> 07:40.159
Father, once you settle everything,

07:40.159 --> 07:42.360
you should move out as soon as possible.

08:00.270 --> 08:01.000
Mother.

08:02.720 --> 08:04.520
My dear mother!

08:07.160 --> 08:08.750
How could you be so cruel

08:10.750 --> 08:13.140
to your own son?

08:34.669 --> 08:36.200
Father!

08:37.299 --> 08:38.179
Heting.

08:38.480 --> 08:39.000
Father!

08:40.720 --> 08:41.480
Stop beating him.

08:41.480 --> 08:42.720
-Father!
-Stop!

08:43.200 --> 08:43.960
Stop it.

08:44.590 --> 08:46.600
Uncle Heting is still her flesh and blood.

08:46.600 --> 08:47.390
Grandmother

08:47.550 --> 08:49.000
is truly ruthless.

08:49.150 --> 08:50.700
Twenty lashes with that iron whip

08:50.700 --> 08:52.300
will tear his skin to shreds.

08:52.640 --> 08:53.670
The Rong family fortune

08:53.670 --> 08:55.400
cannot be destroyed by vermin.

08:55.440 --> 08:56.830
Grandmother is being stern

08:56.830 --> 08:57.310
only to

08:57.330 --> 08:58.960
give the family an explanation.

08:58.960 --> 09:01.670
But it puts you
in a difficult position, Shanbao.

09:01.670 --> 09:04.000
If Father weren't Grandmother's own son,

09:04.240 --> 09:06.780
he wouldn't face
such severe family punishment.

09:06.780 --> 09:09.290
If he weren't the father
of the next family head,

09:09.290 --> 09:11.690
I wouldn't need to handle this personally.

09:11.910 --> 09:12.720
So many eyes

09:12.720 --> 09:14.550
are watching how I deal with this.

09:14.550 --> 09:16.550
It would be easy to pardon him alone.

09:17.150 --> 09:19.210
But for the sake of family sentiment,

09:19.320 --> 09:20.390
to disregard the entire family's interests

09:20.390 --> 09:21.970
and the tea farmers' livelihoods...

09:21.970 --> 09:22.770
In the future,

09:23.550 --> 09:25.480
how could I face our family members

09:26.080 --> 09:27.410
or maintain authority?

09:28.120 --> 09:30.520
Family matters are not the difficult part.

09:30.720 --> 09:33.150
The real trouble lies ahead.

09:35.110 --> 09:36.910
The tea sold by the fake Rongzhai

09:37.240 --> 09:37.790
was all sold

09:37.790 --> 09:39.390
under our family's name.

09:42.240 --> 09:43.040
Lady Shanbao.

09:43.270 --> 09:43.960
Our servants just

09:43.960 --> 09:45.650
questioned the manager
of the fake Rongzhai.

09:45.650 --> 09:46.650
According to him,

09:46.920 --> 09:48.180
not only in the capital

09:48.200 --> 09:50.000
but new shops
have opened in nearby counties too.

09:50.000 --> 09:50.910
Just the ones he knows of

09:50.910 --> 09:52.170
number no less than 12.

09:52.390 --> 09:54.150
The managers in the capital all knew,

09:54.150 --> 09:55.720
but due to the Old Master's position,

09:55.720 --> 09:57.450
no one dared send word to Linji.

09:58.080 --> 09:59.880
Uncle Heting is truly reckless,

10:00.080 --> 10:01.870
not even consulting with Grandmother

10:01.870 --> 10:03.470
and causing such a disaster.

10:03.750 --> 10:04.960
So many shops,

10:04.960 --> 10:06.570
and who knows how much tea they've sold.

10:06.570 --> 10:08.440
He can gather
inferior and aged tea easily,

10:08.440 --> 10:09.510
but our family's tea shops

10:09.510 --> 10:10.480
produce a limited amount

10:10.480 --> 10:11.410
of tea each year.

10:11.510 --> 10:13.180
Moreover, this year's
torrential rains and hail

10:13.180 --> 10:15.040
have ruined countless tea crops.

10:15.200 --> 10:16.600
Outsiders don't know the truth,

10:16.600 --> 10:17.130
but this debt

10:17.130 --> 10:19.150
will all be charged to the Rong family.

10:19.150 --> 10:19.870
This will truly

10:19.870 --> 10:21.800
destroy our family's livelihood.

10:22.480 --> 10:25.030
We must compensate
where we can and make amends.

10:25.030 --> 10:27.560
Money is trivial,
reputation is everything.

10:27.840 --> 10:29.360
If we can't make
full compensation this year,

10:29.360 --> 10:30.820
we'll continue next year.

10:31.000 --> 10:31.630
Yunshu,

10:32.120 --> 10:33.600
go to the Zhuang, Xu

10:33.600 --> 10:35.400
and Zhao family tea shops again.

10:35.720 --> 10:36.960
Ask them to arrange

10:36.960 --> 10:38.750
5,000 jin of top-grade tea leaves

10:38.750 --> 10:40.150
for our emergency needs.

10:41.610 --> 10:43.690
Xiu Qiong, go investigate again

10:44.320 --> 10:45.390
who my father...

10:46.060 --> 10:46.540
No.

10:47.120 --> 10:49.310
Investigate who Madam Liu has been
associating with these past 6 months.

10:49.310 --> 10:49.880
Yes.

10:53.750 --> 10:55.120
You suspect...

10:55.600 --> 10:57.460
With their courage and ambition,

10:57.790 --> 10:59.790
how dare they open so many new shops?

11:00.390 --> 11:01.240
He doesn't have

11:01.240 --> 11:02.300
that much capital.

11:03.160 --> 11:03.820
There must be someone

11:03.820 --> 11:05.420
scheming behind the scenes.

11:05.870 --> 11:07.000
I'd like to see

11:07.630 --> 11:08.750
exactly who

11:09.510 --> 11:11.640
dares to plot against the Rong family.

11:13.510 --> 11:14.150
Report!

11:14.880 --> 11:15.670
Lady Shanbao,

11:15.670 --> 11:17.140
servants from Duke of Yongguo's Mansion
have delivered a visiting card.

11:17.140 --> 11:18.870
Mrs. Xue has come to pay a visit.

11:22.980 --> 11:31.370
[Rong Residence]

11:24.360 --> 11:26.480
Having such an inconsiderate birth father,

11:26.480 --> 11:27.630
if it were anyone else,

11:27.630 --> 11:29.760
they would have fallen apart long ago.

11:29.840 --> 11:32.080
Fortunately she cut
through the mess decisively.

11:32.080 --> 11:32.960
If it had continued for

11:32.960 --> 11:34.130
ten days or half a month more,

11:34.130 --> 11:35.510
it would have become unmanageable,

11:35.510 --> 11:37.710
and Grandmother would have been angry.

11:40.440 --> 11:42.040
What are you thinking about?

11:43.270 --> 11:44.480
Since ancient times,
officials have their ways

11:44.480 --> 11:45.840
and merchants have theirs.

11:45.840 --> 11:47.370
The Rong family is wealthy.

11:47.390 --> 11:49.820
Ordinary impoverished nobles
who want to associate with us

11:49.820 --> 11:51.840
aren't even worth Grandmother's attention.

11:51.840 --> 11:54.240
But Duke of Yongguo's Mansion
holds real power,

11:54.240 --> 11:56.550
and the old Duke has illustrious
military achievements

11:56.550 --> 11:58.280
with great influence at court.

11:58.600 --> 12:01.000
Mrs. Xue personally
came to visit Shanbao.

12:01.670 --> 12:02.700
I fear they

12:02.920 --> 12:06.720
must have ulterior motives
for condescending to associate with us.

12:13.360 --> 12:14.600
The sun is warm today

12:14.600 --> 12:15.600
and there's no wind or dust.

12:15.600 --> 12:17.460
Why wear this troublesome thing?

12:18.150 --> 12:20.140
The customs here differ from the south.

12:20.140 --> 12:22.210
In the capital,
women from wealthy families

12:22.210 --> 12:23.610
rarely show their faces in public

12:23.610 --> 12:24.870
or go out for business,

12:25.080 --> 12:25.510
especially

12:25.510 --> 12:27.030
unmarried young ladies.

12:27.330 --> 12:28.240
Even if they just visit temples

12:28.240 --> 12:29.840
twice a month to offer incense,

12:29.840 --> 12:31.370
they will be gossiped about

12:31.390 --> 12:33.590
and criticized for being unruly women.

12:35.090 --> 12:36.690
To make things easier,

12:36.920 --> 12:38.440
we must follow local customs

12:38.440 --> 12:39.370
and bear with it.

13:00.750 --> 13:03.080
Wild bees insist on chasing winter plums,

13:03.270 --> 13:05.400
not fearing their wings might freeze.

13:14.510 --> 13:15.440
Lady Xiangling!

13:17.480 --> 13:19.010
Bad luck! Let's go quickly.

13:19.390 --> 13:20.720
Are you Lady Xiangling?

13:21.440 --> 13:24.150
I have an urgent matter
and need to see Lady Rong Shanbao.

13:24.150 --> 13:25.080
Mr. Lang, you truly have

13:25.080 --> 13:26.390
keen ears and eyes.

13:26.390 --> 13:28.000
We've only been
in the capital for a few days,

13:28.000 --> 13:29.630
yet you already know everything.

13:29.630 --> 13:30.320
Unfortunately,

13:30.320 --> 13:32.000
Lady Shanbao is entertaining
important guests.

13:32.000 --> 13:33.790
I'm afraid she won't be available today.

13:33.790 --> 13:34.620
My apologies for the poor reception.

13:34.620 --> 13:36.020
Please come back another day.

13:36.020 --> 13:38.420
I'm looking for Lady Shanbao
to save a life!

13:39.600 --> 13:40.550
Whose life?

13:40.970 --> 13:41.730
My Lord.

14:04.740 --> 14:07.030
[Xie Huiqing, Mrs. Xue]

14:21.630 --> 14:22.840
The Rong family
and the Duke of Yongguo's Mansion

14:22.840 --> 14:24.670
have never associated with each other.

14:24.670 --> 14:26.870
Mrs. Xue, I wonder why you

14:27.000 --> 14:29.460
have suddenly
honored us with her presence.

14:29.700 --> 14:31.660
Lady Shanbao,
there's no need to be so modest.

14:31.660 --> 14:33.030
The Rong Mansion dominates the South,

14:33.030 --> 14:34.510
with a formidable reputation.

14:34.510 --> 14:35.670
Even a provincial Governor,

14:35.670 --> 14:36.770
when arriving in Jiangnan,

14:36.770 --> 14:38.770
must first pay respects to Old Madam Rong.

14:38.770 --> 14:40.050
With such prestige

14:40.070 --> 14:41.240
and benevolence,

14:41.660 --> 14:43.870
you're deeply respected
by the local people.

14:43.870 --> 14:45.600
Not just among Jiangnan clans,

14:45.850 --> 14:47.770
but even among the noble families
in the capital,

14:47.770 --> 14:48.970
many cannot compare.

14:49.910 --> 14:51.460
I apologize for my intrusion

14:51.460 --> 14:52.600
with this visit today.

14:52.600 --> 14:54.260
Please forgive me, Miss Rong.

14:55.240 --> 14:57.200
I see you're straightforward

14:57.200 --> 14:58.840
and not concerned with trivial matters.

14:58.840 --> 15:00.100
So I'll speak frankly.

15:01.200 --> 15:02.460
The reason for my visit

15:02.670 --> 15:04.080
is about my brother.

15:05.470 --> 15:06.500
You mean...

15:07.160 --> 15:08.080
Lu Jianglai.

15:11.340 --> 15:11.820
No.

15:13.200 --> 15:14.750
His true surname is Xue.

15:17.320 --> 15:18.450
What are you saying?

15:18.690 --> 15:21.320
Lu Jianglai
is Duke of Yongguo's biological son?

15:21.320 --> 15:21.750
Yes.

15:22.200 --> 15:24.120
That day, an imperial edict arrived

15:24.120 --> 15:26.220
summoning my lord
to report to the capital immediately.

15:26.220 --> 15:27.630
As soon as he left the palace,

15:27.630 --> 15:28.200
he was immediately

15:28.200 --> 15:29.840
invited to Duke of Yongguo's Mansion.

15:29.840 --> 15:31.540
I waited at the post house for days

15:31.540 --> 15:33.070
but there was no sign of him.

15:33.200 --> 15:34.360
I boldly went to inquire

15:34.360 --> 15:36.030
but was turned away at the door.

15:36.030 --> 15:37.080
If Jun Dai hadn't been clever enough

15:37.080 --> 15:38.280
to send a message out,

15:39.000 --> 15:41.240
I would still be in the dark
about what happened.

15:41.240 --> 15:41.790
How dare they

15:41.790 --> 15:43.450
detain an imperial official!

15:43.940 --> 15:45.540
Two years ago, the Duke's heir
unfortunately fell from his horse

15:45.540 --> 15:46.740
and became disabled.

15:46.960 --> 15:49.270
The old Duke has been
ill with grief ever since.

15:49.270 --> 15:51.120
The Emperor has sent medicine 3 times

15:51.120 --> 15:52.840
and dispatched imperial physicians,

15:52.840 --> 15:55.100
showing the Duke enjoys imperial favor.

15:55.110 --> 15:56.450
Now he's using filial piety

15:56.450 --> 15:57.910
to force my lord
to return to his ancestral family.

15:57.910 --> 15:59.020
I fear some nobles in the palace

15:59.020 --> 16:00.320
are willing to facilitate this.

16:00.320 --> 16:02.450
After all, that secret imperial edict

16:02.540 --> 16:04.800
came at a suspiciously convenient time.

16:05.510 --> 16:07.710
If he must return to his family, so be it.

16:07.960 --> 16:10.360
It's wealth and honor
falling from the sky.

16:11.080 --> 16:12.340
Why are you so anxious?

16:13.510 --> 16:15.440
For others, it would be a blessing,

16:15.750 --> 16:18.270
but for my lord, it's a bitter hatred.

16:18.960 --> 16:20.960
I fear he would rather die

16:23.480 --> 16:25.390
than acknowledge his ancestry.

16:27.300 --> 16:29.910
They say there's no marriage
without grievances,

16:29.910 --> 16:31.790
no father-son relationship without enmity.

16:31.790 --> 16:33.600
The past grudges and entanglements

16:33.600 --> 16:35.920
are not for me,
a younger generation, to discuss.

16:35.920 --> 16:37.720
But blood ties are hard to sever.

16:38.200 --> 16:39.910
How can he refuse
to acknowledge his father

16:39.910 --> 16:41.240
and his family forever?

16:41.840 --> 16:43.720
Our dynasty rules through filial piety.

16:43.720 --> 16:44.440
If the Duke

16:44.440 --> 16:45.640
is determined enough

16:45.700 --> 16:47.130
to accuse him of defying his father

16:47.130 --> 16:48.360
and disrespecting filial duty,

16:48.360 --> 16:50.360
he can forget about his official position.

16:50.360 --> 16:52.120
Even if he becomes a common peddler,

16:52.120 --> 16:53.520
he'll still be despised.

16:53.770 --> 16:56.100
What face would
he have left in this world?

16:57.030 --> 16:59.360
Alas, I've said
all the nice words I could,

16:59.550 --> 17:01.280
but he's completely stubborn,

17:01.280 --> 17:03.130
refusing to acknowledge the Duke,

17:03.130 --> 17:04.930
causing chaos in our household.

17:05.680 --> 17:07.880
I've shamelessly come
today to ask for help,

17:07.880 --> 17:09.109
hoping that you

17:09.349 --> 17:10.480
might persuade him.

17:12.000 --> 17:13.859
Mrs. Xue, your words are strange.

17:14.310 --> 17:16.109
This is your family's business.

17:16.349 --> 17:17.960
Why come to my door for help?

17:20.270 --> 17:22.190
Miss Rong, there's no need to pretend.

17:22.190 --> 17:23.170
I'm afraid Secretary Lang

17:23.170 --> 17:24.720
has already come to seek your help.

17:24.720 --> 17:26.440
He didn't go to anyone else,

17:27.030 --> 17:29.020
but specifically came to your chambers.

17:29.020 --> 17:30.330
Surely your relationship

17:30.330 --> 17:31.200
with Lord Lu

17:31.440 --> 17:32.970
is obvious without asking.

17:33.240 --> 17:35.160
The Duke has eyes and ears everywhere,

17:35.160 --> 17:37.550
and has already investigated
my family's situation.

17:37.550 --> 17:38.950
Then you should also know

17:39.240 --> 17:41.030
my engagement with Lord Lu is broken.

17:41.030 --> 17:42.200
We have no further ties.

17:42.200 --> 17:44.130
There is no connection between us.

17:44.170 --> 17:45.570
Which ancestors he acknowledges,

17:45.570 --> 17:46.830
which family temple he worships at,

17:46.830 --> 17:48.160
are all his own affairs.

17:49.070 --> 17:51.400
Mrs. Xue, you've come to the wrong person.

17:53.270 --> 17:55.750
I've just arrived in the capital
and am busy with many matters,

17:55.750 --> 17:57.410
so I cannot entertain guests.

17:57.680 --> 17:59.160
Please see yourself out, Mrs. Xue.

17:59.160 --> 18:01.490
I apologize for not
seeing you to the door.

18:01.750 --> 18:04.600
This engagement isn't something
you can just break off.

18:04.600 --> 18:06.510
The Duke considers you
his daughter-in-law,

18:06.510 --> 18:08.310
so you are the Duke's daughter-in-law.

18:08.310 --> 18:09.640
There's no escaping it.

18:12.920 --> 18:13.720
Your father this year

18:13.720 --> 18:15.250
owes 30,000 jin of tea debt,

18:15.740 --> 18:17.880
which must be giving you quite a headache.

18:17.880 --> 18:20.340
The Duke's Mansion
is willing to intervene.

18:20.350 --> 18:21.880
With the Duke's influence,

18:21.920 --> 18:22.880
all problems

18:22.880 --> 18:24.210
can be easily resolved.

18:24.740 --> 18:25.920
I haven't figured out

18:25.920 --> 18:27.750
my family's accounts out myself,

18:27.750 --> 18:29.750
yet you seem to know them perfectly.

18:30.100 --> 18:31.020
So it seems

18:31.680 --> 18:33.410
you're trying to force my hand.

18:34.110 --> 18:35.350
I apologize for being abrupt.

18:35.350 --> 18:36.620
These words come from me alone.

18:36.620 --> 18:37.960
They are now in your keeping.

18:37.960 --> 18:39.030
How to decide

18:39.030 --> 18:40.270
is up to you.

18:40.790 --> 18:42.450
How can others influence you?

18:43.370 --> 18:44.930
You're busy with important matters.

18:44.930 --> 18:46.060
No need to see me out.

18:46.200 --> 18:47.350
The Duke is at home,

18:47.590 --> 18:49.390
awaiting your favorable reply.

19:06.960 --> 19:08.090
This is outrageous!

19:08.510 --> 19:09.440
I wondered how

19:09.440 --> 19:11.270
this trouble came about so suddenly.

19:11.270 --> 19:13.200
It's all their family's scheming.

19:13.200 --> 19:14.350
The old Duke uses both carrot and stick,

19:14.350 --> 19:15.350
but still failed.

19:15.510 --> 19:16.270
Knowing Lord Lu

19:16.270 --> 19:17.680
is strong-willed
and difficult to manipulate,

19:17.680 --> 19:18.810
and can't be forced.

19:19.110 --> 19:20.200
So he resorts to this scheme,

19:20.200 --> 19:21.480
trapping the Rong family,

19:21.480 --> 19:22.070
which means he's got hold of

19:22.070 --> 19:23.200
Lord Lu's weakness.

19:23.720 --> 19:25.510
To avoid involving you, Lady Shanbao,

19:25.510 --> 19:27.770
Lord Lu will have no choice but to submit.

19:28.000 --> 19:29.110
In others' eyes,

19:30.030 --> 19:31.490
am I really that important

19:31.550 --> 19:32.510
to your lord?

19:33.320 --> 19:35.510
You're certainly someone
very dear to his heart.

19:35.510 --> 19:37.400
All because of Lu Jianglai's involvement.

19:37.400 --> 19:39.500
Who did our family offend?
Who did we provoke?

19:39.500 --> 19:41.160
You shouldn't put it that way.

19:41.510 --> 19:43.910
They've woven their net
and set their trap.

19:44.660 --> 19:45.850
If you hadn't taken the bait,

19:45.850 --> 19:48.050
this disaster wouldn't have happened.

19:50.590 --> 19:51.680
If you must blame someone,

19:51.680 --> 19:53.480
blame Mrs. Rong's endless greed

19:53.590 --> 19:55.350
and Master Rong
allowing his wife to amass wealth.

19:55.350 --> 19:56.750
After all, you can't clap

19:56.810 --> 19:57.920
with just one hand.

19:58.210 --> 19:59.470
You're still going on?

19:59.960 --> 20:01.960
Shanbao, you absolutely cannot go.

20:02.060 --> 20:03.510
That family has ill intentions.

20:03.510 --> 20:04.750
Their methods are ruthless.

20:04.750 --> 20:06.200
They're not to be trifled with.

20:06.200 --> 20:08.460
You must not go under any circumstances.

20:08.590 --> 20:09.680
I must go.

20:12.940 --> 20:14.200
To settle this matter,

20:14.670 --> 20:16.490
we'd have to
run around exhausting ourselves

20:16.490 --> 20:17.770
and owe many favors.

20:18.150 --> 20:19.590
The tea we borrowed this year

20:19.590 --> 20:21.350
will have to be repaid next year.

20:21.350 --> 20:23.350
Whoever tied the knot must untie it.

20:23.730 --> 20:25.530
They've come to us voluntarily,

20:25.610 --> 20:27.410
offering to solve our troubles.

20:27.550 --> 20:29.080
And what's wrong with that?

20:29.680 --> 20:30.940
It's nothing more than

20:31.160 --> 20:32.960
wanting me to act as a mediator.

20:33.200 --> 20:35.860
Lady Shanbao,
I fear they don't want a mediator,

20:36.240 --> 20:38.000
they want to hold you as a hostage.

20:38.000 --> 20:39.440
Old Duke is a battle-hardened veteran,

20:39.440 --> 20:40.790
ruthless in his actions,

20:40.790 --> 20:42.480
who tolerates no disobedience.

20:42.480 --> 20:44.440
He wants to use this matter
to control the Rong family.

20:44.440 --> 20:45.900
Once he takes you captive,

20:46.110 --> 20:48.370
Lord Lu will have no choice but to comply.

20:48.440 --> 20:49.160
Hostage?

20:50.920 --> 20:53.320
They've schemed so much
to invite me there.

20:53.550 --> 20:56.440
Whether it brings fortune or misfortune

20:57.110 --> 20:58.640
depends on their own fate.

21:03.940 --> 21:05.930
[Imperial Yongguo Mansion]

21:28.680 --> 21:29.940
He threw things again?

21:41.870 --> 21:42.870
Master Jianglai.

21:43.310 --> 21:45.290
A father and son reuniting is

21:45.440 --> 21:47.010
only natural and proper.

21:47.470 --> 21:49.110
The Duke is earnestly
keeping you as a guest.

21:49.110 --> 21:49.640
Even the Empress Dowager

21:49.640 --> 21:50.970
has given her approval.

21:51.680 --> 21:52.940
If you have any grievances,

21:52.940 --> 21:54.160
take them out on us servants.

21:54.160 --> 21:55.820
Beat us or scold us as you wish.

21:55.920 --> 21:56.440
Don't keep your anger

21:56.440 --> 21:57.720
bottled up inside.

21:57.920 --> 21:59.240
Making yourself sick with anger

21:59.240 --> 22:00.200
isn't worth it.

22:01.880 --> 22:02.880
Master Jianglai.

22:03.200 --> 22:05.350
It's not that I refuse
to open the door for you.

22:05.350 --> 22:06.880
Last time when you ran away,

22:06.960 --> 22:07.750
the Duke sent

22:07.750 --> 22:09.030
so many officers and guards,

22:09.030 --> 22:10.590
and they barely managed to find you.

22:10.590 --> 22:12.250
I ended up receiving forty...

22:12.510 --> 22:13.750
Forty lashes.

22:14.140 --> 22:15.870
I haven't fully recovered yet.

22:16.600 --> 22:18.510
Please, stop making trouble.

22:19.320 --> 22:20.080
The Duke said

22:20.360 --> 22:21.280
since you're fond of

22:21.280 --> 22:22.920
the eldest young lady
from Rong Mansion in Linji,

22:22.920 --> 22:24.590
he's gone to invite her here for you.

22:24.590 --> 22:26.350
Mrs. Xue has already gone to invite her.

22:26.350 --> 22:27.610
She'll arrive by noon.

22:27.960 --> 22:29.760
She'll come to keep you company,

22:29.970 --> 22:31.970
and you'll surely feel better then.

22:32.310 --> 22:33.440
Get in here now!

22:49.960 --> 22:53.070
Master Jianglai, what are your orders?

22:53.880 --> 22:56.210
Didn't you say an honored guest is coming?

22:57.310 --> 23:00.480
How can I receive visitors
looking like this?

23:02.070 --> 23:03.440
Yes, yes.

23:05.160 --> 23:06.740
Quickly help Master Jianglai wash up.

23:06.740 --> 23:08.800
So he can welcome the honored guests.

23:12.630 --> 23:17.470
[Rong Residence]

23:17.750 --> 23:18.950
Are you really going?

23:19.820 --> 23:21.480
I've been to deserts and seas,

23:21.880 --> 23:23.740
faced sandstorms and huge waves.

23:23.920 --> 23:25.920
Why would I fear the Duke's Mansion?

23:26.070 --> 23:27.200
Of course I'm going.

23:27.790 --> 23:29.510
Shanbao, don't underestimate them.

23:29.510 --> 23:30.550
Lord Lu may thrive in official circles

23:30.550 --> 23:31.680
like a fish in water,

23:31.720 --> 23:33.160
turning danger into safety,

23:33.160 --> 23:34.960
but at the Duke of Yong's mansion

23:35.110 --> 23:36.510
he can hardly make a move,

23:36.510 --> 23:38.040
all because of filial piety

23:38.200 --> 23:39.540
weighing him down.

23:40.070 --> 23:41.140
If you're going...

23:41.790 --> 23:42.270
What?

23:42.750 --> 23:44.480
You're afraid I'll be dragged down too?

23:44.480 --> 23:46.000
Shanbao, please don't joke.

23:46.000 --> 23:46.680
The customs here

23:46.680 --> 23:48.410
are very different from Linji.

23:48.440 --> 23:50.820
Women are confined at home
and restricted everywhere.

23:50.820 --> 23:52.770
Especially in the inner quarters
of noble houses.

23:52.770 --> 23:53.960
I fear you won't be accustomed to it

23:53.960 --> 23:55.680
and might fall victim to others' schemes.

23:55.680 --> 23:56.200
We do not require you

23:56.200 --> 23:57.750
to send an eight-bearer
sedan chair to receive our lady.

23:57.750 --> 23:58.880
When Lady Shanbao goes out,

23:58.880 --> 24:00.530
our household provides our own carriage.

24:00.530 --> 24:01.200
Why do you send

24:01.200 --> 24:02.920
a cramped little sedan chair
to humiliate us?

24:02.920 --> 24:04.180
Look at this yourself.

24:04.910 --> 24:06.110
The door is so narrow.

24:06.510 --> 24:07.720
One must enter sideways.

24:07.720 --> 24:09.220
It's so low you'd hit your head
the moment you step in.

24:09.220 --> 24:11.200
And once inside,
you'd have to sit all hunched up.

24:11.200 --> 24:12.550
Fine, even if you fit in,

24:12.640 --> 24:13.830
can you sit up straight?

24:13.830 --> 24:15.290
What kind of thing is this?

24:15.510 --> 24:17.170
A prestigious Duke's Mansion

24:17.240 --> 24:18.350
can't even send

24:18.350 --> 24:19.550
a decent sedan chair?

24:19.640 --> 24:21.700
Is this not deliberately insulting?

24:25.680 --> 24:27.310
Madam Shanbao,
please don't be upset.

24:27.310 --> 24:29.110
Nonsense! She's no Madam Shanbao!

24:29.110 --> 24:30.710
She is our eldest young lady.

24:31.660 --> 24:32.640
Lady Rong Shanbao

24:32.640 --> 24:33.590
and our Second Young Master

24:33.590 --> 24:34.960
almost completed their wedding ceremony.

24:34.960 --> 24:37.210
Everyone in Linji knows this.

24:37.400 --> 24:38.310
Then you two

24:38.310 --> 24:39.510
are rightfully

24:39.510 --> 24:40.660
an engaged couple.

24:40.980 --> 24:42.370
If we were in Linji,

24:42.750 --> 24:44.020
our Second Young Master

24:44.020 --> 24:45.350
would marry into the Rong family

24:45.350 --> 24:47.480
and follow the Rong family's customs.

24:48.110 --> 24:49.970
But now that we're in the capital,

24:50.440 --> 24:51.160
we must

24:51.160 --> 24:53.200
follow our Second Young Master's status

24:53.200 --> 24:55.640
and address you as Madam Shanbao.

24:56.070 --> 24:57.650
It is our family tradition

24:57.680 --> 24:59.750
to welcome the bride
in a small sedan chair.

24:59.750 --> 25:02.070
Any woman who becomes
another family's daughter-in-law

25:02.070 --> 25:04.110
must first learn to endure,

25:04.350 --> 25:05.880
to yield, to bear hardship.

25:06.240 --> 25:09.190
Only then can she show her gentle virtue

25:09.270 --> 25:10.670
and refined upbringing.

25:11.240 --> 25:12.200
This sedan chair

25:12.510 --> 25:14.240
was used by Mrs. Xue

25:14.240 --> 25:15.310
in the past.

25:16.480 --> 25:18.240
Though the door looks narrow,

25:18.510 --> 25:19.400
the inside

25:19.400 --> 25:21.270
is quite spacious and comfortable.

25:21.270 --> 25:23.800
Madam Shanbao,
please get in the sedan chair.

25:24.160 --> 25:26.400
Shanbao, I wasn't exaggerating.

25:26.770 --> 25:28.170
You've seen it yourself.

25:58.470 --> 25:59.330
Madam Shanbao.

25:59.790 --> 26:01.390
Madam Shanbao, you mustn't!

26:01.680 --> 26:02.880
If you go like this...

26:02.950 --> 26:04.030
-And when others see it...
-Madam Shanbao.

26:04.030 --> 26:05.240
They'll surely gossip about it.

26:05.240 --> 26:05.980
Madam Shanbao!

26:05.980 --> 26:07.070
Don't block the way.

26:07.070 --> 26:07.510
You...

26:09.550 --> 26:10.010
Depart.

26:10.510 --> 26:11.000
You...

26:11.720 --> 26:12.580
Madam Shanbao!

26:13.880 --> 26:14.790
Madam Shanbao!

26:21.720 --> 26:23.070
Go, hurry up and follow.

26:24.960 --> 26:26.750
Ma'am, you must be joking.

26:27.110 --> 26:28.510
We only have these legs.

26:28.570 --> 26:29.750
How can we keep up with

26:29.750 --> 26:31.070
that magnificent steed?

26:31.070 --> 26:32.070
If you want to catch up,

26:32.070 --> 26:33.670
you'd better go by yourself.

26:36.240 --> 26:37.500
Return to the mansion.

26:38.820 --> 26:40.220
-Close the door.
-You...

26:40.240 --> 26:41.600
You are extremely rude!

26:48.160 --> 26:50.160
Madam, a servant reported

26:50.690 --> 26:52.280
that Miss Rong from Linji

26:52.690 --> 26:54.150
was too proud of her status

26:54.240 --> 26:56.590
and refused to ride
in the sedan chair we sent.

26:56.590 --> 26:58.550
She prepared her own
lavish carriage to visit.

26:56.960 --> 26:59.570
[Ms. Chang, Duchess of Yongguo]

27:04.470 --> 27:05.140
Wanniang.

27:07.200 --> 27:08.000
Yes, Mother.

27:09.750 --> 27:11.640
You were entrusted by the Old Master

27:11.640 --> 27:13.700
to personally visit this young lady.

27:14.510 --> 27:15.440
In your opinion,

27:16.920 --> 27:18.350
what kind of person is she?

27:18.350 --> 27:19.240
Mother,

27:20.270 --> 27:22.250
I only met Miss Rong briefly,

27:22.930 --> 27:24.790
so I don't yet know her character.

27:24.790 --> 27:26.100
From her appearance,

27:26.640 --> 27:28.270
she seems noble and dignified,

27:28.270 --> 27:30.000
a graceful and beautiful lady.

27:30.510 --> 27:31.270
Is that so?

27:36.640 --> 27:37.960
In this world,

27:39.000 --> 27:40.590
how could there be

27:40.790 --> 27:43.350
a daughter who would banish
her father from the clan?

27:43.350 --> 27:45.810
Even if her father
committed a grave mistake

27:46.080 --> 27:48.150
and disobeyed her grandmother's orders,

27:48.150 --> 27:49.590
as a daughter,

27:49.880 --> 27:52.110
she should kneel and beg again and again.

27:52.110 --> 27:53.420
Even if it meant not eating or drinking,

27:53.420 --> 27:54.480
starving to death,

27:54.740 --> 27:57.550
she should have sought
her grandmother's forgiveness.

27:57.550 --> 27:58.980
But look at her!

27:59.310 --> 28:00.700
From so far away,

28:01.000 --> 28:01.990
she sent a horrible order

28:01.990 --> 28:03.830
to expel his father from the clan.

28:03.830 --> 28:06.030
And she can remain completely unmoved.

28:06.030 --> 28:07.150
One can imagine

28:08.240 --> 28:10.880
how cold-hearted she must be.

28:11.940 --> 28:14.000
I sent a small sedan chair to receive her

28:14.000 --> 28:14.610
precisely to

28:14.610 --> 28:16.100
test her temperament.

28:16.490 --> 28:19.160
If she were respectful and gentle,

28:19.180 --> 28:21.240
a lady who follows proper etiquette,

28:21.310 --> 28:22.750
she would be like you,

28:22.920 --> 28:24.520
arriving in the sedan chair.

28:24.920 --> 28:27.510
But she deliberately changed
to her own carriage,

28:27.510 --> 28:28.510
which was enough to prove

28:28.510 --> 28:31.480
her defiant nature—

28:31.880 --> 28:33.840
a fierce, untamable woman.

28:34.720 --> 28:35.910
I've heard

28:36.270 --> 28:37.840
that in the Rong family from Linji,

28:37.840 --> 28:39.640
the women behave wantonly,

28:40.310 --> 28:42.100
disregarding proper etiquette,

28:42.100 --> 28:44.580
spending their days among men,

28:45.470 --> 28:47.730
speaking and acting without restraint.

28:47.750 --> 28:48.860
Such a woman

28:49.170 --> 28:51.300
would bring misfortune to any family.

28:52.130 --> 28:55.260
The Old Master shouldn't
have brought her into our home.

28:56.160 --> 28:57.420
Mother, you're right.

28:58.350 --> 28:59.410
His Highness acted

28:59.670 --> 29:01.440
to persuade Jianglai
to return home.

29:01.440 --> 29:03.840
Mother, please be patient a little longer.

29:04.030 --> 29:05.290
Don't bother with her.

29:06.110 --> 29:08.390
A virtuous wife
keeps her husband from trouble.

29:08.390 --> 29:09.930
Seductive women without virtue

29:09.930 --> 29:11.330
are nothing but trouble.

29:12.400 --> 29:13.750
I certainly hope

29:13.960 --> 29:16.030
the Old Master gets his way this time.

29:16.510 --> 29:17.750
I don't want this woman

29:17.750 --> 29:20.210
to bring any misfortune
into our household.

29:20.470 --> 29:21.080
Wanniang.

29:21.700 --> 29:23.720
You'd better go welcome her yourself.

29:23.720 --> 29:25.680
Don't let her cause any trouble.

29:27.310 --> 29:27.900
Yes.

29:32.830 --> 29:34.200
Beyond the small willow grove

29:34.200 --> 29:34.870
stands Xianyi Pavilion,

29:34.870 --> 29:37.000
bearing an inscription
personally bestowed by His Majesty.

29:37.000 --> 29:38.350
The Duke once

29:38.350 --> 29:40.080
beat His Majesty at chess here.

29:40.240 --> 29:41.510
The Lansha Hall to the east

29:41.510 --> 29:42.640
was where the Duke

29:42.640 --> 29:43.840
studied in his youth.

29:44.510 --> 29:46.130
On the rockery in the southwest corner

29:46.130 --> 29:47.380
stands the Buyi Pavilion.

29:47.380 --> 29:49.310
You can view maple leaves
in autumn and snow in winter.

29:49.310 --> 29:50.820
The scenery is magnificent.

29:50.820 --> 29:52.020
Past this corner gate

29:52.370 --> 29:53.700
is the inner residence.

29:54.480 --> 29:56.550
Madam Chang is very strict about rules.

29:56.550 --> 29:57.660
I'm afraid...

30:01.750 --> 30:03.480
You don't need to follow us any further.

30:03.480 --> 30:04.870
Lady Shanbao, your status is exalted.

30:04.870 --> 30:06.480
Old Madam repeatedly instructed

30:06.480 --> 30:06.980
and ordered me

30:06.980 --> 30:08.310
to never leave your side

30:08.640 --> 30:09.970
and ensure your safety.

30:10.820 --> 30:12.300
Even if you order otherwise,

30:12.300 --> 30:13.950
I dare not comply.

30:14.550 --> 30:15.810
The kindness of elders

30:15.820 --> 30:17.080
must never be refused.

30:17.200 --> 30:19.000
I can't ask them to leave either.

30:19.390 --> 30:21.550
Mrs. Xue, please have someone guide them

30:21.550 --> 30:24.370
to the outer courtyard
for temporary accommodation.

30:24.370 --> 30:25.750
The capital is different from our home.

30:25.750 --> 30:27.350
You must behave yourselves.

30:27.360 --> 30:28.680
Don't wander around without reason,

30:28.680 --> 30:30.550
and never disturb the host family.

30:30.550 --> 30:31.000
Yes.

30:37.880 --> 30:39.740
Please follow me to meet the Duke.

30:40.550 --> 30:42.200
He's still breathing,

30:42.310 --> 30:44.510
yet she brings his enemy into the house.

30:44.790 --> 30:47.180
Just to appear as a virtuous wife,

30:47.350 --> 30:49.610
while pushing her husband toward death.

30:50.120 --> 30:52.560
What a black-hearted, shameless woman!

30:53.480 --> 30:55.550
The most virtuous woman in the world?

30:56.200 --> 30:57.240
Bah!

30:56.270 --> 30:57.630
[Xue Yingchuan, Princess Jinxiang]

31:07.110 --> 31:07.720
Please.

31:12.210 --> 31:13.970
In my army, during battle,

31:14.000 --> 31:16.160
killing one enemy
exempts a family from labor service.

31:16.160 --> 31:17.720
Whoever takes an enemy officer's head

31:17.720 --> 31:19.880
will be rewarded with land and a mansion.

31:19.880 --> 31:21.270
Military discipline
has always been strict,

31:19.920 --> 31:22.220
[Loyalty and Filial Piety Endure]

31:21.270 --> 31:23.200
and rewards and punishments just.

31:23.200 --> 31:25.060
The same applies in my household.

31:25.540 --> 31:26.820
Serve diligently,

31:27.070 --> 31:28.560
and you'll be generously rewarded.

31:28.560 --> 31:30.350
Anyone who dares to be negligent

31:30.350 --> 31:32.150
will be punished a hundredfold.

31:32.510 --> 31:33.970
A perfectly good tea tree,

31:34.330 --> 31:36.140
and seven or eight of you
can't keep it healthy.

31:36.140 --> 31:37.250
What use are you then?

31:37.250 --> 31:38.280
Mercy, Your Highness!

31:38.280 --> 31:39.680
Spare us, Your Highness!

31:40.070 --> 31:41.160
I truly don't know

31:41.550 --> 31:43.200
what disease the tea tree has.

31:43.200 --> 31:45.260
I've never seen this disease before.

31:45.590 --> 31:46.850
Mercy, Your Highness!

31:49.360 --> 31:49.920
Stop.

31:54.640 --> 31:56.170
Don't be afraid, Miss Rong.

31:56.680 --> 31:58.960
His Highness has been
rather short-tempered lately.

31:58.960 --> 32:00.380
When servants make small mistakes,

32:00.380 --> 32:01.510
he flies into a rage.

32:02.100 --> 32:04.030
If you could persuade

32:04.060 --> 32:05.840
Master Jianglai to change his mind,

32:05.840 --> 32:06.790
all these problems

32:06.790 --> 32:08.830
would turn from misfortune to fortune.

32:08.830 --> 32:10.490
That would be their blessing.

32:18.160 --> 32:19.250
Go inform the Duke

32:19.510 --> 32:21.040
that Miss Rong has arrived.

32:21.060 --> 32:21.540
Yes.

32:29.000 --> 32:29.860
Your Highness.

32:30.520 --> 32:31.720
Let me examine

32:31.960 --> 32:33.620
what disease the tea tree has.

32:39.640 --> 32:41.910
Wanniang, please explain to her.

32:42.710 --> 32:43.140
Yes.

32:44.810 --> 32:45.500
Miss Rong.

32:50.590 --> 32:52.640
These tea trees are extremely significant.

32:52.640 --> 32:54.550
They once saved His Highness's life.

32:54.550 --> 32:55.280
Previously,

32:55.480 --> 32:57.640
when His Highness was fighting
in the southwest border,

32:57.640 --> 32:58.700
it was a remote area

32:58.790 --> 33:00.120
with harsh conditions.

33:00.580 --> 33:01.380
Once,

33:01.800 --> 33:03.300
His Highness led 2,000 light cavalry

33:03.300 --> 33:04.520
pursuing enemy forces

33:04.520 --> 33:06.480
when they accidentally
entered a misty forest.

33:06.480 --> 33:07.790
Fog was everywhere,

33:07.860 --> 33:09.070
making it impossible to find direction.

33:09.070 --> 33:09.790
For 7 days and nights,

33:09.790 --> 33:11.200
they couldn't find clean water

33:11.200 --> 33:12.730
and nearly perished there.

33:13.050 --> 33:14.270
Fortunately, His Highness

33:14.270 --> 33:16.130
found more than 10 wild tea trees.

33:16.410 --> 33:17.690
By chewing tea leaves,

33:18.000 --> 33:19.510
they found a chance for survival.

33:19.510 --> 33:21.420
Finally, they found a way
out of the mountains

33:21.420 --> 33:22.620
and returned safely.

33:23.160 --> 33:24.680
Later, His Highness

33:24.960 --> 33:26.360
brought back 6 tea trees.

33:26.870 --> 33:28.400
They were fine for the first 2 years.

33:28.400 --> 33:29.530
But since last year,

33:29.730 --> 33:31.620
the tea trees began to wither and die.

33:31.620 --> 33:33.350
Many tea masters were consulted,

33:33.350 --> 33:34.750
but none could save them.

33:59.850 --> 34:01.020
Near the tea trees,

34:01.790 --> 34:03.190
are there roses planted?

34:03.880 --> 34:04.810
Answer quickly.

34:05.770 --> 34:06.310
Yes.

34:06.740 --> 34:08.870
There are about 10 rose bushes nearby.

34:08.880 --> 34:09.469
They were all

34:09.469 --> 34:10.800
planted by Madam Chang herself back then.

34:10.800 --> 34:11.760
Speaking of those roses,

34:11.760 --> 34:13.210
they bloom rather poorly.

34:13.210 --> 34:14.469
Two have already died.

34:15.760 --> 34:18.420
Black whiteflies
parasitize the back of leaves

34:18.540 --> 34:20.480
and easily cause various tea diseases.

34:20.480 --> 34:21.360
Over time,

34:21.670 --> 34:23.080
just like this tea tree,

34:24.130 --> 34:26.210
not only do leaves yellow and fall off,

34:26.210 --> 34:27.670
but branches also wither.

34:28.150 --> 34:31.040
From a single rose, the disease
can spread through the tea grove,

34:31.040 --> 34:33.370
leaving large numbers of tea plants dead.

34:34.330 --> 34:36.179
To prevent the disease from spreading,

34:36.179 --> 34:38.870
the best solution
is to uproot them completely

34:39.420 --> 34:40.380
and burn them.

34:43.170 --> 34:44.170
Can you cure them?

34:45.400 --> 34:46.030
Yes, I can.

34:46.590 --> 34:47.230
Good.

34:48.150 --> 34:49.230
Then stay here

34:49.670 --> 34:51.030
and treat my tea trees.

34:52.880 --> 34:54.110
Please give me an axe.

34:56.230 --> 34:56.800
Yes.

35:00.670 --> 35:01.330
Your Highness,

35:01.330 --> 35:03.230
you care so much about these tea trees,

35:03.230 --> 35:05.480
but do you know why they're sick?

35:06.280 --> 35:07.410
You just told us.

35:08.010 --> 35:08.930
I'm not deaf.

35:16.730 --> 35:18.930
This disease isn't difficult to treat.

35:19.900 --> 35:21.300
Experienced tea farmers

35:21.550 --> 35:23.830
know how to pick leaves
and prepare medicine.

35:23.830 --> 35:25.400
But once the roots are damaged,

35:25.400 --> 35:27.530
treatment can only help temporarily.

35:27.890 --> 35:30.330
It will eventually wither and die.

35:32.030 --> 35:33.440
That's why the tea farmers you've hired

35:33.440 --> 35:34.640
can't fix the problem

35:34.950 --> 35:36.810
and don't dare tell you the truth.

35:37.330 --> 35:39.840
Your Highness claims
to care for these tea trees,

35:39.840 --> 35:41.700
but it's all about your own whims.

35:42.200 --> 35:43.320
You grow tea trees

35:43.680 --> 35:46.190
without considering
what each variety needs,

35:46.190 --> 35:47.790
doing only what pleases you.

35:48.750 --> 35:51.480
Tea trees grow naturally
on hills and mountains.

35:51.730 --> 35:53.460
Their roots need to grow deep

35:53.490 --> 35:54.960
in warm, moist, sandy loam

35:54.960 --> 35:55.840
to thrive.

35:56.540 --> 35:57.840
You've trapped these tea trees

35:57.840 --> 35:59.450
in small containers,

35:59.800 --> 36:01.060
using heavy clay soil,

36:01.320 --> 36:03.420
placing them
in sunny spots sheltered from wind.

36:03.420 --> 36:05.230
If the tea tree doesn't die today,

36:05.230 --> 36:06.830
it will surely die tomorrow.

36:06.900 --> 36:08.360
Are you showing gratitude

36:08.630 --> 36:09.760
or seeking revenge?

36:09.840 --> 36:10.630
How dare you!

36:19.800 --> 36:21.230
Are you talking about tea

36:22.280 --> 36:23.190
or people?

36:24.320 --> 36:25.850
Your suspicion is correct.

36:26.340 --> 36:28.730
I'm talking about Lu Jianglai.

36:29.920 --> 36:30.660
Miss Rong,

36:31.280 --> 36:32.410
you shouldn't be

36:32.430 --> 36:33.840
so disrespectful before His Highness.

36:33.840 --> 36:35.590
Your Highness has fought
valiantly on battlefields,

36:35.590 --> 36:37.030
achieved remarkable merits,

36:37.030 --> 36:39.320
earning respect from everyone
inside and outside the court.

36:39.320 --> 36:41.320
Who would dare offend your dignity?

36:42.080 --> 36:44.840
However, the Rong family
also has its principles.

36:44.840 --> 36:47.350
Respect others,
and you'll be respected in return.

36:47.350 --> 36:48.610
If you show me respect,

36:48.870 --> 36:50.200
I'll return it tenfold.

36:50.270 --> 36:52.070
But if someone takes advantage,

36:52.140 --> 36:53.580
tries to intimidate,

36:53.610 --> 36:55.060
or bullies others with their power,

36:55.060 --> 36:57.120
then don't blame me for fighting back

36:57.360 --> 36:59.020
and refusing to yield an inch.

37:09.710 --> 37:10.910
What do you dare to do?

37:12.030 --> 37:13.400
Your Highness keeps forcing

37:13.400 --> 37:14.660
Lu Jianglai to submit,

37:15.260 --> 37:16.670
using both threats and bribes,

37:16.670 --> 37:18.400
trying every possible method.

37:18.400 --> 37:19.800
Haven't you considered that

37:19.800 --> 37:21.070
when his fortunes wither

37:21.070 --> 37:23.930
and his mind is consumed
by demons of his own making,

37:24.000 --> 37:25.960
his pride broken and will crushed,

37:26.400 --> 37:28.000
will he still be

37:28.000 --> 37:29.260
the son you truly want?

37:29.400 --> 37:30.760
I fear by then,

37:31.290 --> 37:34.750
whatever bond you share
will be no different from this tree...

37:55.280 --> 37:57.670
Dying a slow death.

38:10.230 --> 38:11.290
That won't happen.

38:11.840 --> 38:13.570
You have a natural gift for tea.

38:14.310 --> 38:15.570
As long as you're here,

38:16.480 --> 38:18.070
it won't wither and die.

38:20.800 --> 38:21.710
You act very much like
your grandmother did

38:21.710 --> 38:22.770
when she was young.

38:24.140 --> 38:25.920
I can't remember which year it was.

38:25.920 --> 38:28.320
When supplies
were most scarce at the front,

38:28.320 --> 38:29.510
your grandmother led a merchant convoy,

38:29.510 --> 38:30.480
risking great danger

38:30.480 --> 38:31.230
to deliver

38:31.230 --> 38:33.540
200,000 shi of military provisions to me.

38:33.540 --> 38:34.540
Even to this day,

38:35.000 --> 38:37.000
I haven't forgotten this kindness.

38:38.570 --> 38:39.980
I had wanted to keep

38:40.070 --> 38:42.280
the horses and carts
that transported the provisions.

38:42.280 --> 38:44.590
But then she...

38:45.480 --> 38:46.080
Look here.

38:46.880 --> 38:48.400
She cut a big gash on me.

38:50.110 --> 38:51.570
So many years have passed.

38:52.150 --> 38:54.050
It became a deep scar.

38:55.030 --> 38:57.510
She said her carts were heading north.

38:58.130 --> 39:00.800
The tea stock from that year
hasn't been cleared yet.

39:00.800 --> 39:01.460
You tell me.

39:02.070 --> 39:03.110
A woman so fierce and fearless,

39:03.110 --> 39:04.640
daring in thought and deed,

39:04.730 --> 39:06.990
is one I have seen
only once in a lifetime.

39:07.170 --> 39:08.830
Thankfully she's not my wife,

39:09.150 --> 39:11.280
or I'd be driven mad with frustration.

39:15.040 --> 39:17.570
Her granddaughter
is also quite courageous.

39:18.180 --> 39:19.180
My son is lucky

39:19.210 --> 39:20.380
to find a wife

39:21.090 --> 39:22.450
like you.

39:27.340 --> 39:28.200
Your Highness.

39:28.990 --> 39:31.450
Master Jianglai
is still waiting to see her.

39:31.920 --> 39:34.480
Go on. Try to persuade him.

39:35.650 --> 39:37.110
If you can't convince him,

39:37.550 --> 39:38.270
he'll never

39:38.290 --> 39:39.400
be allowed to come out again.

39:39.400 --> 39:39.840
Yes.

40:01.130 --> 40:01.930
Open the door!

40:02.590 --> 40:04.190
Didn't you say she had arrived?

40:04.190 --> 40:05.720
Why isn't the door open yet?

40:06.630 --> 40:07.480
Where is she?

40:08.070 --> 40:09.200
Open the door for me!

40:09.280 --> 40:09.800
Hurry!

40:15.970 --> 40:16.970
Master Jianglai.

40:27.310 --> 40:31.980
♪ Get caught in a heavy, wild snowfall ♪

40:31.650 --> 40:32.300
Bao.

40:32.060 --> 40:35.790
♪ Watch magpies fluttering past my eyes ♪

40:35.990 --> 40:40.140
♪ It's tormenting itself all alone ♪

40:39.590 --> 40:40.110
Master Jianglai!

40:40.110 --> 40:40.590
Jianglai!

40:40.370 --> 40:44.470
♪ Unable to find any peers
for a get-together ♪

40:44.190 --> 40:46.000
Quick, help me take him inside.

40:44.810 --> 40:48.980
♪ Wait for a perfectly full moon ♪

40:46.070 --> 40:46.550
Yes.

40:48.990 --> 40:53.280
♪ Yet every slice of it seems incomplete ♪

40:53.310 --> 40:57.290
♪ Is it because my prayers
are too presumptuous? ♪

40:57.520 --> 41:02.290
♪ Or do I lack a bit
of the sacrificial blood? ♪

41:05.190 --> 41:09.700
♪ The biting cold wind
makes me stumble as I run ♪

41:09.730 --> 41:14.120
♪ Laughing innocently,
I find my spirit broken ♪

41:14.380 --> 41:16.800
♪ Just like this,
I'm drunk in a spring night ♪

41:16.830 --> 41:19.470
♪ Just like this,
I'm lost in enduring hardships ♪

41:19.680 --> 41:22.260
♪ Intertwined with you ♪

41:22.280 --> 41:26.540
♪ No longer fret over who loves more ♪

41:26.560 --> 41:31.130
♪ Gradually rid myself
of the snakes and scorpions in my heart ♪

41:31.880 --> 41:35.090
♪ Drink a cup
filled with bold passion ♪

41:35.110 --> 41:38.930
♪ Sing a line
about lovebirds and butterflies ♪

41:39.380 --> 41:42.930
♪ Put an end to all karmic ties and sins ♪

41:41.510 --> 41:42.320
So pitiful.

41:43.400 --> 41:45.130
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

41:50.960 --> 41:53.230
Don't worry. I'm not going anywhere.

42:10.920 --> 42:11.400
Bao.

42:13.960 --> 42:14.510
Bao.

42:21.190 --> 42:21.760
Bao.

42:24.280 --> 42:25.340
Don't move around.

42:27.400 --> 42:28.670
Bao, leave.

42:29.620 --> 42:30.480
Leave quickly.

42:31.960 --> 42:32.920
Then let go of me,

42:33.470 --> 42:35.070
and I'll leave immediately.

42:39.480 --> 42:40.280
Sit still.

42:41.880 --> 42:42.360
Here.

42:51.760 --> 42:52.960
I heard you haven't had

42:52.960 --> 42:54.490
any food or water for 7 days.

42:55.100 --> 42:57.430
Are you trying to die
of thirst and hunger?

42:57.840 --> 42:59.170
Drink this water first.

43:02.000 --> 43:04.230
Bao, don't go.

43:06.710 --> 43:07.770
You must not leave.

45:41.580 --> 45:44.020
[Tibetan butter tea]

45:54.310 --> 45:55.870
[What to Drink for Afternoon Tea
in the Depths of Winter?]

45:56.000 --> 45:56.880
Tibetan butter tea

45:56.880 --> 45:58.810
is a traditional Tibetan beverage

45:59.030 --> 46:01.190
originated in China's
Qinghai-Tibet Plateau

46:01.190 --> 46:02.920
with a history of over a thousand years.

46:02.920 --> 46:04.230
People in highland regions

46:04.230 --> 46:05.800
need high-calorie foods

46:05.820 --> 46:06.880
to resist the cold.

46:06.920 --> 46:08.590
But vegetables are scarce there.

46:08.590 --> 46:10.840
Tea drinking not only aids digestion

46:10.920 --> 46:13.000
but also maintains
the body's acid-base balance.

46:13.000 --> 46:13.510
It compensates for

46:13.510 --> 46:14.960
deficiencies in the dietary structure.

46:14.960 --> 46:17.620
In Tibetan areas, tea
is typically made by mixing tea leaves,

46:17.620 --> 46:19.300
brick tea or Pu'er tea,

46:19.590 --> 46:21.480
with butter extracted from yak milk

46:21.480 --> 46:22.630
and salt,

46:22.960 --> 46:24.320
adding sesame seeds, walnuts

46:24.320 --> 46:25.590
and other ingredients.

46:25.590 --> 46:27.400
It's repeatedly churned in a Duomu pot

46:27.400 --> 46:28.670
to create a nutritious,

46:28.670 --> 46:30.480
high-calorie Tibetan butter tea.

46:30.480 --> 46:31.230
Tibetan butter tea

46:31.230 --> 46:33.070
is a product of
Han-Tibetan cultural integration.

46:33.070 --> 46:34.800
And it is an essential part

46:34.800 --> 46:35.630
of China's diverse

46:35.630 --> 46:36.880
tea culture.

46:37.060 --> 46:38.600
It embodies the Chinese nation's

46:38.600 --> 46:40.560
inclusive and diverse tea culture.
